1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,863
Lost a receipt you need?

2
00:00:02,163 --> 00:00:02,840
Don’t panic.

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,120
You can often rebuild it.

4
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,630
One. Search your email for the amount.

5
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:08,165
Many stores send a copy.

6
00:00:08,465 --> 00:00:09,860
Two. Ask the store.

7
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:10,675
Some can reprint it

8
00:00:10,675 --> 00:00:12,209
from the date and your card.

9
00:00:12,509 --> 00:00:14,019
Three. Check the order history

10
00:00:14,019 --> 00:00:15,205
in your online account.

11
00:00:15,505 --> 00:00:16,720
Four. Still gone?

12
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,240
Save the statement line,

13
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,770
and write down what you bought and why.

14
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:20,470
Today.

15
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,205
A receipt is the strongest proof.

16
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:24,516
But IRS guidance allows

17
00:00:24,516 --> 00:00:26,673
other supporting documents too.

18
00:00:27,123 --> 00:00:29,035
Next time, snap it at the counter.

19
00:00:29,035 --> 00:00:31,095
Ten seconds beats this whole search.

20
00:00:31,595 --> 00:00:33,545
Find us at receipt-nest.com,

21
00:00:33,545 --> 00:00:35,293
on the App Store and Google Play.
